Subject: [PATCH] docs: document touch posture and add a tablet-switch
 simulator

- docs/touch-posture.md: contract v2 (launch/resume arguments, size policy,
  why 17 in is the docking limit, touch device flag, resume behaviour, laptop
  and slate indicator, handheld mode);
