- docs/configuration.md and docs/api.md: the new options and endpoints;
- scripts/sim-tablet-switch.py: Linux helper that creates a uinput device with a
  SW_TABLET_MODE switch, so a Linux Moonlight posture client sees a keyboard
  detach/attach and reports it to /posture without a real convertible.

